              "description": "<ul>\n<li>added new helper method for customitemserviceextended for secure filters</li>\n<li>added missing properties to clothing configs for questrequirements and achievementrequirements (skillrequirements will have to wait until next major SPT verison)</li>\n<li>fixed side locked quests not working properly /bonk</li>\n<li>added buyrestrictionmax for trader barters in customitemserviceextended</li>\n<li>added new customaudioservice for facecard and radio audio</li>\n<li>renamed customprofileservice method from add to create for consistency</li>\n</ul>\n",
